00:34:00.000 --> 00:34:37.000
for the first time in a month. And the whole idea is reinforce my belief in humanity and human kindness. So thank you very much for keeping the hope alive. And please keep the conversation going. It may seem surprising that Wafa's month in the paintball gallery, left him feeling optimistic about humanity. But he's not alone in that optimism. Jamil Zaki also thinks there are ways we might use technology

56
